# Copy this file to .env and fill in real values. .env is git-ignored and
# loaded automatically by cmd/server on startup (see loadDotEnv in main.go) —
# a real environment variable, if set, always takes precedence over this file.

# Gmail OAuth (candidate auto-apply sending) — from Google Cloud Console:
# APIs & Services -> Credentials -> OAuth 2.0 Client ID (Web application).
# Leave all three empty to disable Gmail integration entirely.
FAANGJOBS_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
FAANGJOBS_GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
# Must match exactly what's registered as an Authorized redirect URI in
# Google Cloud Console.
FAANGJOBS_GOOGLE_REDIRECT_URL=http://localhost:8080/api/crm/gmail/callback

# AI that writes every application letter from the vacancy + the candidate's
# CV/profile. Set at least one key; with both set, FAANGJOBS_LETTER_AI picks
# (groq | claude), otherwise Groq wins. No key = auto-apply disabled.
# Groq: https://console.groq.com/keys (CV text via pdftotext / poppler-utils)
GROQ_API_KEY=
# GROQ_MODEL=openai/gpt-oss-120b
# Claude: https://platform.claude.com/settings/keys (reads PDF CVs directly)
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# FAANGJOBS_LETTER_AI=

# 42.uz authentication (optional — leave empty to keep the board open).
# FAANGJOBS_JWT_SECRET=
# FAANGJOBS_AUTH_API=https://api.42.uz
# FAANGJOBS_LOGIN_URL=https://42.uz/login
# FAANGJOBS_ENROLL_URL=https://42.uz/course/devops
